---
import { site } from '../../config/site';
---

<section class="now-section section-pad" id="now">
  <div class="section-heading reveal-up">
    <p class="eyebrow">/ now</p>
    <h2>这段时间，<em>正在发生</em>。</h2>
    <p>不是履历，是此刻打开的几个 tab。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="now-board reveal-up" style="--delay: 100ms">
    <div class="now-board-top">
      <span class="board-label">CURRENT STATUS</span>
      <span class="board-date">updated {site.now.updatedAt}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="now-items">
      <div class="now-item now-item-main">
        <span class="now-index">01</span>
        <div><span class="now-kicker">currently building</span><strong>{site.now.building}</strong></div>
        <span class="now-scribble" aria-hidden="true">✎</span>
      </div>
      <div class="now-item">
        <span class="now-index">02</span>
        <div><span class="now-kicker">exploring</span><strong>{site.now.exploring}</strong></div>
      </div>
      <div class="now-item">
        <span class="now-index">03</span>
        <div><span class="now-kicker">learning</span><strong>{site.now.learning}</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
